"""Visual, concern-led pathways: educational decisions rather than prescribed bundles."""
FLOW_DATA=[
('CLEAR','Acne & congestion','Jerawat & komedo','Understand the breakout','Kenali jerawatnya','Your doctor checks the type of acne and whether medical treatment is needed.','Dokter memeriksa jenis jerawat dan kebutuhan pengobatan.','Control active acne','Kendalikan jerawat aktif','Build the prescribed home-care plan. Clinic procedures are optional additions, not a substitute for acne medication.','Susun perawatan rumah sesuai resep. Tindakan klinik adalah tambahan pilihan, bukan pengganti obat jerawat.','Review before treating scars','Tinjau sebelum merawat bekas','Once acne is controlled, discuss marks or scars separately.','Setelah jerawat terkendali, bahas noda atau bopeng secara terpisah.',['hydraderm','chemical-peel','pdt-celluma'],'https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/acne/derm-treat/treat/'),
('TONE','Sunspots, freckles & uneven tone','Flek, freckles & warna tidak merata','Identify the pigment','Kenali jenis pigmen','Sunspots, freckles, post-acne marks, and melasma need different plans. A new or changing spot needs medical assessment first.','Flek matahari, freckles, noda jerawat, dan melasma memerlukan rencana berbeda. Bercak baru atau berubah perlu diperiksa dahulu.','Protect, then select','Lindungi, lalu pilih','Start with sun protection and doctor-advised skincare. Discuss a pigment procedure only if suitable; melasma needs particular care.','Mulai dengan proteksi matahari dan skincare anjuran dokter. Bahas tindakan pigmen bila sesuai; melasma perlu perhatian khusus.','Review pigment & recovery','Tinjau pigmen & pemulihan','Check response and irritation before deciding whether to continue, change, or pause.','Periksa respons dan iritasi sebelum melanjutkan, mengubah, atau menjeda.',['biaxis-qs-laser','ipl-cellec','chemical-peel'],'https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/a-z/melasma-treatment'),
('TEXTURE','Acne scars & texture','Bopeng & tekstur','Separate scars from active acne','Bedakan bopeng dari jerawat aktif','Control active acne first. Your doctor assesses scar shape, depth, and skin tone.','Kendalikan jerawat aktif dahulu. Dokter menilai bentuk, kedalaman bekas, serta warna kulit.','Choose a scar-specific approach','Pilih pendekatan sesuai bekas','Microneedling may be one option. Different scars may need a different procedure or referral; a facial is not equivalent to scar treatment.','Microneedling bisa menjadi pilihan. Jenis bekas berbeda dapat memerlukan tindakan lain atau rujukan; facial tidak setara dengan perawatan bopeng.','Allow healing, then compare','Beri waktu pulih, lalu bandingkan','Review healing and gradual change using comparable photographs. Further sessions depend on response.','Tinjau pemulihan serta perubahan bertahap dengan foto sebanding. Sesi berikutnya bergantung respons.',['nanopore'],'https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/acne/derm-treat/scars/treatment'),
('CALM','Sensitivity & redness','Sensitif & kemerahan','Find the cause','Cari penyebabnya','Redness can have several causes. Tell the doctor about stinging, flaking, products, and recent treatments.','Kemerahan dapat memiliki beberapa penyebab. Ceritakan perih, mengelupas, produk, dan tindakan terakhir.','Simplify & support','Sederhanakan & dukung','Follow a gentle, clinician-advised routine. A procedure can wait if skin is irritated; doing less may be the right next step.','Ikuti rutinitas lembut anjuran klinisi. Tindakan dapat ditunda saat kulit iritasi; mengurangi langkah bisa tepat.','Reassess comfort first','Nilai kenyamanan dahulu','Discuss optional supportive care only when suitable. Persistent or worsening symptoms need reassessment.','Bahas perawatan pendukung bila sesuai. Gejala menetap atau memburuk perlu dinilai kembali.',['aquapure-h2o','pdt-celluma'],None),
('TIGHTEN','Firmness & contour','Kekencangan & kontur','Identify what is changing','Kenali perubahannya','Skin laxity, volume changes, and expression lines are different concerns. Your doctor checks anatomy and expectations.','Kulit kendur, perubahan volume, dan garis ekspresi berbeda. Dokter menilai anatomi dan harapanmu.','Choose one suitable direction','Pilih arah yang sesuai','Discuss RF or focused ultrasound if appropriate. They are alternatives with different targets—not automatic steps in one session.','Bahas RF atau ultrasound terfokus bila sesuai. Sasaran keduanya berbeda—bukan urutan wajib dalam satu sesi.','Recover & allow time','Pulih & beri waktu','Follow aftercare and review at the doctor-set time before considering another procedure.','Ikuti pascaperawatan dan tinjau pada waktu yang ditentukan dokter sebelum mempertimbangkan tindakan lain.',['pollogen-rf','hifu-liftera'],None),
('ENHANCE','Skin quality & expression lines','Kualitas kulit & garis ekspresi','Name the actual goal','Tentukan tujuanmu','Hydration, expression lines, and contour are different goals. Discuss which one matters to you.','Hidrasi, garis ekspresi, dan kontur adalah tujuan berbeda. Bahas yang paling berarti untukmu.','Match the product to the goal','Sesuaikan produk dengan tujuan','Botulinum toxin acts on selected muscles; skin boosters vary by product. They are not interchangeable. Discuss suitability and risks first.','Botulinum toxin bekerja pada otot tertentu; skin booster berbeda menurut produk. Keduanya tidak saling menggantikan. Bahas kesesuaian dan risiko dahulu.','Review before adding more','Tinjau sebelum menambah','Let the response develop and attend the agreed review. More treatment is not always the next step.','Beri waktu respons berkembang dan ikuti tinjauan yang disepakati. Menambah tindakan tidak selalu menjadi langkah berikutnya.',[],None)]

def flow_url():return tr('treatment-flows.html','alur-treatment.html')
def flow_map(code=None):
 active=code or 'CLEAR';choices='';panels=''
 for row in FLOW_DATA:
  c,en,id,h1,i1,p1,q1,h2,i2,p2,q2,h3,i3,p3,q3,devices,source=row
  choices+='<button type="button" data-flow-choice="'+c+'" aria-pressed="'+str(c==active).lower()+'" aria-controls="flow-'+c+'">'+c+'<small>'+tr(en,id)+'</small></button>'
  stages=[(tr('START HERE','MULAI DI SINI'),tr(h1,i1),tr(p1,q1)),(tr('YOUR PLAN','RENCANAMU'),tr(h2,i2),tr(p2,q2)),(tr('REVIEW','TINJAU'),tr(h3,i3),tr(p3,q3))]
  steps=''.join('<li><span class="flow-number">0'+str(n+1)+'</span><span class="kicker">'+k+'</span><h3>'+h+'</h3><p>'+p+'</p></li>' for n,(k,h,p) in enumerate(stages))
  options=''
  for ds in devices:
   d=next(x for x in C['education']['devices'] if x['slug']==ds)
   url='edukasi-'+ds+'.html'
   options+='<a class="flow-option" href="'+url+'"><b>'+e(d['name'])+'</b><span>'+tr('How it works + recovery ↗','Cara kerja + pemulihan ↗')+'</span></a>'
  if c=='ENHANCE':
   for t in C['education']['treatments']:
    if 'Botulinum' in t['name'] or 'Skin Booster' in t['name']:options+='<a class="flow-option" href="'+treatment_url(t)+'"><b>'+e(t['name'])+'</b><span>'+tr('How it works + recovery ↗','Cara kerja + pemulihan ↗')+'</span></a>'
  panels+='<article class="flow-panel" id="flow-'+c+'" data-flow-panel="'+c+'" '+('' if c==active else 'hidden')+'><div class="flow-heading"><span class="kicker">'+c+'</span><h3>'+tr(en,id)+'</h3></div><ol class="flow-track">'+steps+'</ol><div class="flow-branch"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><p>'+tr('Inside step 02: possible options · choose only if suitable','Di langkah 02: pilihan untuk dibahas · hanya bila sesuai')+'</p></div><div class="flow-options">'+options+'</div><div class="flow-checkpoint"><b>'+tr('Before any procedure','Sebelum tindakan')+'</b><span>'+tr('Agree on the goal, full cost, downtime, risks, and aftercare. You can choose to wait.','Sepakati tujuan, biaya lengkap, downtime, risiko, dan pascaperawatan. Kamu boleh memilih menunggu.')+'</span></div><div class="flow-loop"><span aria-hidden="true">↻</span><p>'+tr('Review → continue, adjust, pause, or move to maintenance.','Tinjau → lanjutkan, sesuaikan, jeda, atau masuk perawatan pemeliharaan.')+'</p></div>'+link(tr('Discuss this pathway on WhatsApp ↗','Bahas alur ini melalui WhatsApp ↗'),'menu.html?concern='+c+'#book','button')+(('<p class="disclaimer">'+link(tr('Clinical background ↗','Referensi klinis ↗'),source)+'</p>') if source else '')+'</article>'
 return section(title(tr('YOUR TREATMENT MAP','PETA PERAWATANMU'),tr('See the path.<br>Know your next step.','Lihat alurnya.<br>Pahami langkah berikutnya.'),tr('Tap a concern to explore a possible journey. Your doctor personalises the plan; these are decision maps, not fixed treatment packages.','Pilih keluhan untuk melihat kemungkinan perjalanan. Dokter menyesuaikan rencana; ini peta keputusan, bukan paket treatment wajib.'))+'<div class="flow-choices" aria-label="'+tr('Choose your concern','Pilih keluhanmu')+'">'+choices+'</div><div aria-live="polite">'+panels+'</div>','treatment-flow','treatment-flow')

_flow_menu=menu_page
def menu_page():
 body=_flow_menu();return body.replace('</section>','</section>'+flow_map(),1)
_flow_programme=programme
def programme(code):
 body=_flow_programme(code);return body.replace('<section class="section faq-section"',flow_map(code)+'<section class="section faq-section"',1)
_flow_home=home
def home():return _flow_home()+section(title(tr('NOT SURE WHERE TO BEGIN?','BINGUNG MULAI DARI MANA?'),tr('Your concern. A clearer path.','Keluhanmu. Alur yang lebih jelas.'))+link(tr('Explore the visual treatment maps ↗','Lihat peta treatment visual ↗'),flow_url(),'button'))
_flow_footer=footer
def footer():return _flow_footer().replace('<b>'+tr('Explore','Jelajahi')+'</b>','<b>'+tr('Explore','Jelajahi')+'</b>'+link(tr('Visual treatment maps','Peta treatment visual'),flow_url(),''))
_flow_extra=extra_routes
def extra_routes():
 global EN
 _flow_extra()
 for lang in ['id','en']:
  EN=lang=='en';render(OUT/('en' if EN else '')/flow_url(),hero(tr('VISUAL TREATMENT GUIDE','PANDUAN TREATMENT VISUAL'),tr('From concern<br>to a care plan.','Dari keluhan<br>ke rencana perawatan.'),tr('Understand the decisions before choosing a treatment.','Pahami keputusannya sebelum memilih treatment.')).replace('href="#content"','href="#treatment-flow"')+flow_map(),tr('Visual treatment pathways','Peta alur treatment'),'../alur-treatment.html' if EN else 'en/treatment-flows.html')
